@hub = http://localhost:5012
@crm = http://localhost:5112

### Development token
POST {{hub}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "demo-client",
  "clientSecret": "dev-only-client-secret",
  "scopes": ["hub.read", "hub.write", "hub.admin"]
}

### CRM first page
GET {{crm}}/api/contacts?page=1&pageSize=2
X-Api-Key: dev-only-simulator-key
